---
const problems = [
  { icon: '📉', title: 'Your money is losing value daily', body: 'Inflation is quietly erasing the purchasing power of every naira sitting idle in your account.' },
  { icon: '🔀', title: 'Your income and wealth are disconnected', body: 'High earners across Nigeria are cash-flow positive on paper and still not building wealth. The problem is structure.' },
  { icon: '🎯', title: 'You\'re investing on guesswork', body: 'Group chats, hot tips and gut feel are not an investment strategy. You need a framework built on your actual numbers.' },
  { icon: '🗂️', title: 'Your finances are scattered', body: 'Income, savings, investments and debts live in separate places. No single view tells you the truth.' },
  { icon: '🏁', title: 'You have goals but no roadmap', body: 'The ambitions are clear. The next twelve concrete steps are not and so nothing moves.' },
  { icon: '⏳', title: 'You keep waiting to start', body: 'Waiting until you know enough, earn enough or have enough. The right moment never arrives on its own.' },
]
---
<section id="why" class="py-20 md:py-28 px-6" style="background: #F9F8F5;">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mb-12">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-black/50 mb-5">
        <span class="h-px w-6 bg-[#FFBD40]"></span>
        The reality
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-black leading-tight tracking-tight">
        The problem isn't your income.<br>
        <span class="text-black/40 italic font-normal">It's the structure around it.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg text-black/60 leading-relaxed">
        In a high-growth economy with persistent inflation and currency volatility, managing your finances on guesswork is no longer an option. The professionals building wealth right now aren't earning more they have a better system.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mb-12">
      {problems.map((p) => (
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-black/10 p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-4">{p.icon}</div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-black mb-2">{p.title}</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-black/60 leading-relaxed">{p.body}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <a href="#offer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#FFBD40] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-black hover:brightness-95 transition">
      Join the Waitlist →
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
